    "comment": "Teribe (5092-tfr) = Threatened (20 percent certain, based on the evidence available) (\"language use has begun a steady decline since Spanish-language schools were introduced in the early 1970s. But the Teribes are aware of the problem and do not want to see their language go the way of Térraba. It remains to be seen what they will do about it.\" (Oakes 2001:4)) [Oakes 2001](cldf:oakes:01)"
